SY_TALK("OIjC6juXz0o",[[87,["Today we are celebrating the resurrection","of Christ."]],[93,["With it we have to also celebrate","the resurrection of human beings,"]],[100,["of Sahaja Yogis who have been resurrected","as realised souls."]],[109,["With that we have to understand that","we enter into a new awareness."]],[119,["There was no need for Christ to enter","into any new awareness,"]],[124,["He had to come down and again to show","to this world"]],[129,["that you are the eternal life, that you","lead a life"]],[142,["that is spiritual, which never perishes."]],[146,["You have to rise into that new realm"]],[152,["which is the realm of God Almighty,"]],[160,["what you call ‘The Kingdom of God’."]],[163,["And He said it very clearly to Nicodemus","that, “You are to be born again.”"]],[174,["And when he asked, “Am I to enter back","into my mother’s womb to be born again?”"]],[181,["But He said it so clearly! It’s so clear."]],[184,["Those who don’t want to see can remain","blind!"]],[188,["But he said it very very clearly that,","“No,” that is,"]],[194,["“whatever is born of the flesh is","the flesh,"]],[199,["but whatever is born of the Spirit","is the Spirit.”"]],[207,["I mean, nothing could be more clear","than that,"]],[211,["that it has to be born of the Spirit."]],[217,["Of course, human beings have a special","capacity to twist everything around."]],[222,["For them Spirit could be a book, could be","some words,"]],[226,["could be an organisation, a church,"]],[229,["or some sort of a thing like that which","they have made."]],[232,["But whatever is man-made is not the Spirit,"]],[239,["this is the clear statement of Christ,","which people wanted to avoid"]],[244,["and start their own organisations,","their own ideas"]],[250,["and created a very mythical thing","in His name."]],[257,["And now the time has come for it","to be blasted."]],[263,["It has been going on and on for thousands","of years,"]],[267,["captured so many innocent people,","and people are into it."]],[274,["But when you are resurrected, when you","become realised souls,"]],[281,["one has to understand that now your","movement is inward,"]],[291,["you are moving towards your roots","and not outside."]],[295,["So whatever was the endeavour before","realisation"]],[306,["has to be changed, the direction has","to be changed,"]],[310,["and that point mostly we miss."]],[316,["This is the thing, today, [that] I am","trying to explain to you."]],[322,["That, so far, to a human mind entertainment","was important; entertaining."]],[332,["To the mind, not to the Spirit."]],[336,["Entertainment to the Spirit is absolutely","opposite to the entertainment to the mind."]],[347,["Like somebody the other day telephoned","to me and said that,"]],[353,["“Mother, there is no excitement","in Sahaja Yoga.”"]],[364,["The excitement is too much."]],[369,["We are going against that."]],[374,["We are going towards peace, not towards","excitement"]],[378,["and this kind of electric-shocks that we","require every time."]],[382,["You see, a drunkard – he’s all right in","the morning but evening-time he goes off,"]],[389,["he needs a shock, a, some sort","of an injection into his body."]],[394,["All human enterprises have been like that.","They are to excite your body."]],[403,["Because if it is the dead you are dealing","with, then you have to excite it."]],[409,["But something that is living, that is","eternal,"]],[413,["you have to enjoy it and not to excite it."]],[417,["So the direction has to be juxtaposition,"]],[424,["and that is where many Sahaja Yogis","fail to understand."]],[431,["How do we do it? Is the point."]],[435,["How do we make our attention move inward","instead of going outward?"]],[444,["If you start from the time you are born","again, it is much easier,"]],[453,["because it’s a new venture into [which]","you go in."]],[457,["That is the peace, peace of your Spirit,","the joy of your Spirit,"]],[464,["which is permanent, you don’t need","any excitement from it,"]],[467,["it is permanent, it is eternal."]],[474,["So the first thing that comes to our mind","is that whatever we do"]],[481,["before realisation we have not to do."]],[488,["The first and foremost thing is [that]","realisation comes to you effortlessly."]],[495,["So the effort which is built in your body","all the time, the energy of effort,"]],[500,["“I must do this, I must do that, I have","to do this, I have to do that!”"]],[504,["That creates tension, that I have told you","already."]],[509,["So what do we do?"]],[514,["We do not try to compete with others."]],[525,["We do not try to fix certain timings,","dates, watches."]],[539,["We do not also put our attention"]],[545,["into any endeavour which puts us","into effort,"]],[552,["but we relax that attitude of effort."]],[558,["It’s called as, in Sanskrit, prayatna","shaithilya."]],[561,["For a western mind it’s very difficult","to grasp the subject so try to understand."]],[570,["That doesn’t mean lethargy, doesn’t","mean lethargy."]],[575,["One should never confuse with the dead,","the energy of the living."]],[583,["Now we are trying to transform our energies","towards the energy of the Spirit."]],[593,["So you have to allow the Spirit","to take over."]],[600,["Your effort of your mind should be reduced"]],[604,["and the energy of the Spirit should work","through you."]],[609,["Now how do you do it?"]],[616,["First is detachment, detachment."]],[625,["Detachment start with the thought, let us","see the thought."]],[632,["It’s called as vichara shaithilya –","relaxation of the thought."]],[636,["Now a thought is coming into your mind,","some thought [like],"]],[641,["“Today is Mother’s puja, let’s go. We have","to hurry up.” You see, “Must get this,"]],[645,["you didn’t get the flowers, now you go","to the Third World and get the flowers."]],[649,["You must get this and you must get that”"]],[652,["Second [thought] is: “No. Detach yourself."]],[661,["Witness. Leave it to the Spirit. Watch.”"]],[669,["You’ll get it. Many of you have noticed","this."]],[674,["But still this mind, which is quite silly,","tries to impress upon you"]],[680,["that you have to use the old junky","instrument of this mind."]],[689,["And it asserts that “Better use.” And when","you start using that,"]],[695,["ego comes in, you get attached to it,"]],[700,["and what you lose is your progress","and thus the joy is minimised."]],[708,["How do you detach yourself?"]],[712,["For a person who is absolutely detached","is very difficult"]],[715,["to explain how to detach, isn’t it?"]],[721,["I’ll try! Now. I cannot get attached.","That’s the problem is."]],[731,["And I find it difficult to explain to you","in words which are human words,"]],[736,["but still, I’ll try to say now."]],[743,["Say, I tried something as human beings do,","in the beginning,"]],[747,["just to see how it works out; because I had","to experiment."]],[752,["For example, when I had to, say, attend","any puja or anything,"]],[758,["I used to ask them, “What is the auspicious","time?”"]],[766,["So they would tell me, “This is","the auspicious time.”"]],[769,["And then another would telephone to say,","“This is the auspicious time.”"]],[773,["So I said, “How can there be two auspicious","times?”, you see,"]],[775,["[it’s a] big problem with human beings."]],[777,["So they said, “There are 5 Panchangas","in India.”"]],[783,["Means 5 books to consult the auspicious","time."]],[787,["That’s what human beings have done.","I said, “Then why consult?"]],[790,["It’s better not to have 5 auspicious times,","isn’t it?”"]],[795,["Then the auspicious time has to be","beyond time."]],[803,["But it is bound in the time the way human","beings have made it,"]],[809,["so it is bound in the time. Like in India,","it is so much, so much, so much,"]],[813,["but now, here (in London) it’s different.","Then you calculate, you have a watch."]],[818,["You see, to overcome all these hurdles","human beings also make certain devices."]],[824,["So you consult. “Now what is the auspicious","time here?” – leave at that time."]],[831,["Then it’s a big headache because there are","5 books to be consulted,"]],[838,["watch could be wrong, this could be wrong,","that could be so."]],[843,["But if you are the Spirit, then the Spirit","works out auspiciousness."]],[850,["It is the Spirit that works out","the auspiciousness."]],[854,["And imagine when you think like that,","how much tension goes out."]],[859,["First of all you have to be a slave","of the watch;"]],[862,["another, you have to be the slave","of the books,"]],[864,["then you have to be the slave","of the market,"]],[870,["of the room, of the place which you have","to hire."]],[875,["But supposing if you allow the Spirit","to work it out,"]],[881,["then everything will work out. And you","will reach at the point"]],[886,["when it is the most auspicious."]],[889,["So how do you accept it? Just by accepting."]],[896,["So, just now if you give up your satta,","your own domain,"]],[903,["you get into the domain of your Spirit."]],[909,["You give up your domain, that is your","ego’s domain,"]],[914,["or may be your super-ego’s domain.","You give up that"]],[918,["and try to see things how it works out."]],[924,["Now, what is the testing point of it?","How do you test it?"]],[930,["It works out. That’s the point of testing."]],[937,["It works out. Allow it to work out."]],[942,["Don’t put your attention."]],[946,["Attention [word] has the second part of,","is the ‘tension’."]],[950,["And don’t try to say, “Why not today,","it should have happened today,"]],[955,["we expected it to happen. Why not","at this moment?”"]],[960,["That’s your ego. “Thy will be done”."]],[969,["So the thought that starts moving","in our mind"]],[977,["all the time, which creates tensions is not","the thought of the Spirit."]],[983,["So, what you should say [is], “Not this","thought. Not this thought.”"]],[989,["“Ya neti, neti wachane nigamor awachus”"]],[992,["“Not this thought, not this thought,","not this thought”,"]],[997,["and see how you relax. Now you are","relaxing -"]],[1000,["“Not this thought, not this thought”."]],[1003,["Just go on refusing accepting any thought."]],[1008,["So you go into Nirvichara. In that state","you feel the Spirit."]],[1016,["Christ has done the greatest work on this,","I should say, but we do not understand"]],[1021,["because His life was like a micro-thing,","you see, 3 years."]],[1028,["So we have to open it out a little bit","and see what He did."]],[1033,["He has given us the greatest weapon","of forgiveness."]],[1039,["When you forgive a person, what do you do?"]],[1044,["You accept the situation, to begin with,","and secondly you forgive"]],[1053,["what you think has been done wrong to you."]],[1057,["But because nothing can be done wrong","to your Spirit,"]],[1063,["you just forgive, because you are","the Spirit!"]],[1068,["And when you forgive, you have found","that your tension goes away."]],[1075,["So even to your thoughts if you say,","“All right, forgive this thought,"]],[1079,["forgive this thought,” because thought is","also not to be punished."]],[1085,["“Forgive this thought, forgive this","thought, forgive everything.”"]],[1090,["Not forget, forgive:"]],[1094,["because then you will even forget that","you are the Spirit!"]],[1102,["But “forgive all the thoughts that","are coming to me.”"]],[1105,["Just go on saying this, is a mantra.","What is a mantra?"]],[1110,["Is that power of the word that expresses","Spirit."]],[1120,["So this is a very important thing Christ","has given us:"]],[1123,["the weapon of forgiveness. Everybody","has that weapon,"]],[1128,["everyone can use that weapon. You don’t","have to put in any effort for it,"]],[1134,["you don’t have to pay for it, it’s just you","have to say, “I forgive.”"]],[1140,["You’ll be amazed your nerves will soothe","down, this tension,"]],[1146,["this pressure of these modern things","will be reduced"]],[1154,["if you go on saying, “I forgive, I forgive","them”."]],[1158,["For example, you go and see some sort of a…"]],[1163,["I mean, if you happen suddenly to see","something very filthy"]],[1167,["according to the Spirit."]],[1170,["Maybe it is very exciting according","to normal human beings,"]],[1175,["but we are abnormal people and for us","if we find it rather ugly"]],[1181,["then the best thing is, to get over,","is to say, “I forgive,"]],[1184,["because they are ignorant, they are blind,","they are not yet there where I am."]],[1190,["I am the one who is at the Source","of enjoyment,"]],[1194,["at the Source of peace and while these","are not, so I forgive.”"]],[1203,["And you’ll be amazed that this forgiveness","that Christ gives you"]],[1209,["works out vichara shaithilya, is","the relaxation of the thought."]],[1219,["Now this opposite movement, that you have","to move,"]],[1225,["first of all should start at this point,","today, from forgiving others."]],[1235,["Now what happens when you forgive someone?","That means you do not react."]],[1240,["The power to react to somebody’s injuries,","insults is finished."]],[1250,["And when that power is finished, you become","a powerful person,"]],[1255,["because nobody can now overpower you,"]],[1262,["because nobody can kill you, nobody can","hurt you,"]],[1267,["nobody can do anything to you."]],[1271,["But it is not, again I’ll say,","shamelessness."]],[1274,["You see, people can think that it is","shamelessness."]],[1280,["So if somebody says to you something harsh"]],[1287,["and something that is wrong, you do not","accept it."]],[1292,["But supposing I shout at someone,","the bhoots run away."]],[1295,["You have seen that many-a-times, I have","to shout at people,"]],[1299,["so bhoots run away because they react,","and they just run away,"]],[1303,["but the Spirit shines through."]],[1308,["So in Sahaja Yoga one has to understand","that it is just this central path,"]],[1316,["is just the balancing thing which is","important. It’s not an extreme of anything."]],[1323,["Like when we go to say that you must","forgive everyone,"]],[1327,["it’s not going to that extreme where you","have done some wrong,"]],[1332,["and somebody says to you [and] you don’t","take that part of it, it doesn’t mean that."]],[1337,["Again discretion is the engine of your","movement."]],[1343,["So you have to see that, if they have","said it,"]],[1348,["something like that, “Is it? Have I gone","against the Spirit?”"]],[1354,["Otherwise, if I say to you something, you","will say, “All right, forgive Mother!”"]],[1359,["You see the point is? “Forgive Her","for saying so.” No."]],[1367,["You cannot say that to Me!"]],[1371,["So then, that is the point [from which]","you start thinking,"]],[1379,["“Why Mother said so? What have I done?”"]],[1382,["Now think on those lines – so you start","moving again."]],[1385,["It’s a very thin road on which you have","to walk."]],[1392,["One side is the huge, big Gibraltar,","rock of Gibraltar, of your ego,"]],[1400,["the another side is a super-ego."]],[1404,["In between is a small discretion path","going,"]],[1409,["on which you have to see both the sides,"]],[1413,["whether you are hitting yourself with","the rock of Gibraltar,"]],[1418,["or falling into the valley of super-ego,"]],[1423,["you should see that you are using","your discretion."]],[1427,["So the another thing one has to remember","[is] that whatever you were doing"]],[1433,["before realisation, is to go to extremes."]],[1436,["For example now, you start some sort","of a movement."]],[1441,["Say, you say, “We’ll have classical","things!” All right."]],[1445,["Then you go so classical that it becomes","mechanical."]],[1449,["Now you’ll say, “Give up! We’ll start","anti-culture”."]],[1452,["So you go to another side that you become","primitive."]],[1455,["Till you have reached the end of it and","learnt a lesson of your life,"]],[1459,["you do not return. But in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1462,["it’s a very slippery road on which we are","walking,"]],[1468,["and there you have to see that it’s not","your ego and it is not your super-ego."]],[1473,["So discretion has to be used very much,","and the balance,"]],[1478,["in this movement, which we need not use","otherwise."]],[1485,["Till we are absolutely destroyed we can go","ahead with it, before realisation."]],[1491,["But in Sahaja Yoga, as soon as you leave","your discretion,"]],[1495,["you fall this side or that side."]],[1499,["Now those people who are of high quality"]],[1503,["Sahaja Yogis take to discretion first:","“How far to go?”"]],[1509,["Now for that Mother doesn’t have to say","because you are the Spirit."]],[1514,["You yourself, you are the Spirit. First","of all assume your position as a Spirit,"]],[1519,["and then move with it, that you see,","discreetly,"]],[1523,["how far to go, how far not to go."]],[1530,["Now that is one of the things: that you","have to become thoughtless"]],[1535,["by becoming a forgiving person."]],[1541,["Most of the thoughts will drop out once","you become forgiving."]],[1544,["But you cannot forgive some people,","like you cannot forgive God,"]],[1548,["you cannot forgive Mother. Certain things","you cannot do,"]],[1552,["so the Maryadas must be seen."]],[1557,["Now, in these boundaries if you walk","properly, you can go ahead."]],[1565,["This is the thing which brings you","vichara shaithilya"]],[1568,["or you can call – the mind becomes relaxed."]],[1575,["Then you have to have vishayatha","shaithilya:"]],[1578,["means your organs, sense organs, always","react to things,"]],[1583,["because you are human beings, you see,","you are born like that."]],[1586,["So, whatever happens you react."]],[1593,["For example, you see a beautiful flower,","you react to it."]],[1599,["Some sort of a thought rises with it."]],[1605,["Now you must practice to see something","without allowing any thought to rise,"]],[1613,["then you start sucking through your Spirit"]],[1618,["the beauty, the glory, the fragrance","of a flower."]],[1627,["Every flower is a poetry, but when you","start thinking about it"]],[1636,["then it becomes a dead thing. But you","just try to enjoy."]],[1641,["Now you are the people who are","on this earth to enjoy yourself,"]],[1649,["not to worry about anything. Just enjoy!"]],[1653,["But if you are still used to,"]],[1658,["“I must do this thing special, I am","something special Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1663,["I’m a very highly evolved Sahaja Yogi”,","then you are finished."]],[1670,["Say, we are all going in a boat, enjoy","the boat and also the waves."]],[1676,["But somebody says, “I’m a very special one,","I’ll try to jump down,”"]],[1683,["then you are back again into the same","position."]],[1688,["So one has to have an attitude","of looking at things."]],[1693,["Try to develop this habit of looking","at things without thinking about it."]],[1700,["Try to develop your mind on those lines","that you do not react."]],[1706,["Now this excitement business, or all this","sensationalisation that is today’s craze,"]],[1715,["comes from the same [source]: that","your sense organs"]],[1719,["require a kind of sensation because","they react."]],[1723,["While we must have our sense organs","which do not react,"]],[1727,["because they must only react to the Spirit."]],[1732,["So we have to develop a new type of sense","organs or a new quality of sense organs"]],[1741,["who do not react to outside excitement."]],[1747,["Now if you want Sahaja Yoga to be","excitement, how can you do it?"]],[1751,["I mean just, it is just the opposite of it."]],[1758,["So what you have to do is to see"]],[1762,["that your sense organs, say for example","your eyes,"]],[1767,["they see something then they react."]],[1771,["Your ears, they hear something [and]","they react."]],[1778,["Somebody wants to talk and see","the reaction –"]],[1785,["there are expectations (of a reaction)."]],[1791,["But because Spirit is active itself,"]],[1798,["it acts itself – you have seen vibrations","don’t speak, they act –"]],[1804,["It has the power to act, [so] you need","not react."]],[1813,["If you can reduce the power of reaction","you rise much higher."]],[1822,["This is a thing which one has to know","when now"]],[1829,["we are celebrating His resurrection:","because it is tapah,"]],[1835,["it is the penance of Christ. Christ came","on this earth for penance."]],[1841,["You know in the Gayatri mantra, there are","7 things they have said [in] it,"]],[1847,["and at the point of Christ it is tapah,","is the penance."]],[1852,["So you have to have so-called penance","to achieve the joy."]],[1858,["The penance is to pull back your sense","organs inside yourself."]],[1865,["As Krishna has said that you have","to pull back"]],[1869,["all your limbs of sense organs like","a tortoise does."]],[1879,["So the excitement that you require"]],[1886,["for your sense organs is no more needed,"]],[1893,["because your sense organs, now, are","themselves the source of excitement."]],[1904,["In the sense that they neutralise","all the excitements."]],[1913,["You go to that point from where it starts."]],[1919,["A river starts with a very small,","little drop,"]],[1923,["and then it expands, expands, expands,","expands."]],[1927,["You go to the source, absolutely","to the central point,"]],[1933,["there you’ll find hardly even a drop falling on you."]],[1938,["Another good example would be: a wheel","has the central point,"]],[1946,["and the wheel moves all the time but","the central point has to be fixed,"]],[1950,["otherwise the wheel, with the wheel","[if] that central point also moves,"]],[1957,["then the cart cannot move, [the] cart will","also start rolling down."]],[1962,["So the central point has to be fixed","otherwise the wheel cannot move."]],[1968,["So you go to that central point, and","the movement is on the central point"]],[1974,["where there is no movement, in a way,"]],[1982,["because there’s only ascent, there’s","no revolution."]],[1987,["It doesn’t revolve any more, there’s just","ascent on the central point."]],[1995,["I hope you try to understand that all","the movements come out of ignorance."]],[2001,["All the outer movements come because we are","not yet on the central point."]],[2008,["But that achievement is not difficult","because you have jumped onto it."]],[2016,["But you again come out onto the periphery,","onto the wheel."]],[2022,["So how to keep there, and to ascend","in that line?"]],[2027,["Say, for example, there are wheels","like this, wheels after wheels,"]],[2031,["but central point is fixed. Now every time","you jump out,"]],[2037,["now how do you go back to the central","point?"]],[2041,["Is by detachment, by tapah, by penance."]],[2050,["Penance is to deny."]],[2056,["It doesn’t mean asceticism of outside","but asceticism of within."]],[2066,["First of all we must learn to give,"]],[2073,["give to others."]],[2078,["That also sometimes people find it","difficult, I have seen."]],[2081,["Even to give £1, they said,"]],[2084,["for Sahaja Yoga people find it difficult.","I was amazed!"]],[2091,["So to give to others is going to be","even worse."]],[2098,["Try to give to others. Detachment."]],[2104,["So one way is to have forgiveness,"]],[2113,["then second is generosity."]],[2122,["If you work for Sahaja Yoga: “I haven’t","done anything so far”."]],[2128,["Not to react to it what work you have done."]],[2132,["“Oh, it’s pleasure, I did it. It’s my","pleasure, I did it. Just out of pleasure”."]],[2137,["Don’t count it; “I brought four flowers,","she brought two flowers."]],[2144,["I must be paid for one and a half flower.”"]],[2149,["All these calculations are on","the periphery, outside,"]],[2155,["when you were not realised souls. Now","you just don’t count anything else,"]],[2159,["but your blessings. So you be generous."]],[2166,["I have seen now people have different","attachments, subtler ones."]],[2172,["Like attached to their own children.","I have seen people [like that]."]],[2177,["Once their children are born","to Sahaja Yogis,"]],[2180,["then the whole world becomes","their children:"]],[2184,["you spoil them, you spoil yourself."]],[2188,["You are just their trustees."]],[2195,["But to you it becomes a very big thing","that you have produced a child."]],[2200,["Anybody can produce, even a dog produces","a child, what is so great?"]],[2204,["I mean, the bitch."]],[2209,["That’s a funny word to say."]],[2214,["So, to create a child is not something","great, but that you have a child"]],[2220,["in charge of you, which has to work","for God."]],[2226,["You are just in charge. But to identify","that, “This child is great,"]],[2231,["he’s a very big realised soul” and all","that, you see,"]],[2235,["will blast your head completely, because","it is subtler blasting."]],[2240,["It’s like hydrogen bomb."]],[2243,["Ordinary bombs can destroy [a] part of it,","but these subtler bombs are even worse."]],[2248,["And that will spoil the child, that will","spoil"]],[2253,["also you very much in your ascent."]],[2258,["So what you have to do is to see that","if you have a child,"]],[2262,["all right, you are just in charge,"]],[2268,["as you are in charge of all the children","of Sahaja Yogis, not [just] of your own."]],[2274,["Be generous! “Udaara charitraanam","Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam”:"]],[2279,["The person who is a generous person,","for him, the whole world is his family."]],[2284,["So expand yourself. “This is my family,","this is my wife,"]],[2290,["how can I live without my wife, or","my husband, my child, my…”"]],[2295,["This will not help you, this will tie you","down completely."]],[2301,["This is a very subtler thing you start,","because now you are receding back."]],[2307,["First you gave up your family, gave up","your children,"]],[2310,["gave up everything, came to this extreme,","now you are going back."]],[2313,["For Indians they understand that they are","already too much in it,"]],[2317,["so they know that to detach yourself from","your children"]],[2320,["is very important because they are","already in it."]],[2323,["They are too much attached to their","children."]],[2326,["In the beginning, they’ll always tell me,","“My child is like this,"]],[2329,["my mother is like this, my father is like","this, my brother is like this,"]],[2332,["improve my…” and they’ll be all bhoots,","one better than the other!"]],[2338,["Without any discretion, bring all those","relations on my head"]],[2341,["and I feel terrible about it."]],[2344,["Even a farfetched relation of a relation","of a relation of a relation"]],[2348,["they will bring it along that, “You see,","she’s my relation”."]],[2351,["So, in India it’s very important that you","are a relation of such and such person,"]],[2356,["and you may not have anything to do","with that person"]],[2358,["but he’s a relation, so “He is a relation.”"]],[2364,["So, what we understand is that","our relationships"]],[2368,["and our identifications have to be dropped","completely."]],[2375,["We are universal beings now."]],[2382,["So your child is a source of joy – every","child should be the source of joy to you,"]],[2387,["every child should be. Bachelors that way","are better,"]],[2391,["or the ones who are not yet married,","they can enjoy everybody’s child nicely."]],[2397,["But, when you are not a mother and","a father,"]],[2400,["if you are enjoying [other children],","what is so creditable?"]],[2403,["When you become the parents, and then","you enjoy other children"]],[2410,["as much as you enjoy your child, then","your generosity has started."]],[2415,["So the generosity of loving others,","the generosity through compassion."]],[2423,["Compassion doesn’t mean that you should","pity someone but compassion means"]],[2427,["the sharing of personality, sharing","of love personality."]],[2436,["And that is where we miss the point,"]],[2439,["that compassion means if somebody","has to be helped."]],[2443,["Sahaja Yoga compassion is not that,","Sahaja Yoga compassion is – it’s sharing."]],[2451,["Now the fourth thing you have to remember.","What I have told you other?"]],[2456,["First is? Is the forgiveness. First!","According to Me is first is forgiveness."]],[2466,["Second is, you can call it, the compassion,"]],[2474,["or the detachment leading to compassion."]],[2485,["So you can call it the first one","as the forgiveness,"]],[2492,["[then] detachment and thirdly","the compassion."]],[2497,["These are the wheels of your chariot which","moves you."]],[2506,["These are the wheels you should remember."]],[2510,["Now,"]],[2517,["if you go further with it, with","the detachment,"]],[2523,["supposing works out in you, even you","become compassionate, even that comes."]],[2531,["Still what is the judging point? How do you","know that you are all right?"]],[2540,["How do you measure? How do you find out","that you are all right?"]],[2548,["I mean what you call the, take the bearing,","as they say, of the ship."]],[2553,["How do you know? You must have peace,","you should be a peaceful person."]],[2566,["Agitation should be outside,"]],[2572,["but you should be absolutely peaceful","person."]],[2577,["If you are not a peaceful person,","then be sure"]],[2580,["that you are not yet there where you should","have been."]],[2585,["Now you can say that, “Christ also got","very angry,"]],[2594,["Hhe took a whip in His hand and beat","the people, so we can also do the same.”"]],[2600,["You are not Christ. You are not","an incarnation,"]],[2604,["you must know, you are a realised soul."]],[2608,["So you don’t have to take a whip in your","hand and hit others. You cannot."]],[2613,["This is the mistake what the disciples","of Mohammad Sahib have done,"]],[2618,["that they never thought that He was","an incarnation, you see."]],[2620,["All the incarnations have killed. Krishna","has killed, Rama has killed,"]],[2627,["Devi has killed. But you are not the Devi!"]],[2632,["You are not Shri Krishna! So you don’t have","to kill anyone."]],[2639,["You don’t have to show the temper.","So if you still have a temper"]],[2643,["then know that your progress is very slow.","You have to be a peaceful person."]],[2650,["Imagine Sahaja Yogis having a Jihad.","What do you say to that?"]],[2654,["Going with swords in the hand and a spear","in the hand and hitting others."]],[2665,["This point I want to make very clear","because when I am there,"]],[2668,["of course, I am going to tell you everyone,","but when I am not there"]],[2672,["I don’t want you to take in your hands","the swords and things and fight."]],[2684,["What William Blake has written is","for the incarnation."]],[2687,["The Incarnations say, “Give me my…”"]],[2692,["It’s not that you should say now,","“Give me Rama’s Ayudhas.”"]],[2697,["You cannot use. You are not an incarnation."]],[2701,["Because the discretion of these are","effective – yours are not."]],[2713,["So you are not to take any weapon","into your hand or even anger."]],[2722,["Doesn’t behove a Sahaja Yogi at any point,","unless and until I tell you to be angry."]],[2733,["So this is the criteria, that you have to be","a peaceful person, not aggressive person."]],[2742,["Now different people have different type","of aggressiveness."]],[2746,["For example, men would start… men don’t","discuss, you see,"]],[2750,["they just slap you – finished. They","don't argue, they don’t like to argue,"]],[2753,["at a point they’ll go and they’ll just","hit you out and finished."]],[2758,["But women are very good at argument,","and very aggressive,"]],[2763,["very aggressively argumentative. So you","don’t argue: is the second point."]],[2771,["If you are argumentative then know that you","are not yet there where you have to be."]],[2778,["A peaceful person goes to a point and then","argues it out."]],[2783,["If you are argumentative then your progress","is not all right."]],[2792,["So a person has to be absolutely peaceful"]],[2800,["and this peace is the most effective thing.","We are seeking the peace of the universe:"]],[2807,["you cannot achieve it through any one","of these bombs,"]],[2813,["you can only achieve it through the Spirit","which is the source of all the peace."]],[2823,["So, I would request all of you to give up","tempers, angers."]],[2829,["Peace is the greatest powerful thing","on this earth."]],[2835,["There’s a story, a Chinese story,","interesting, about it."]],[2838,["There were two very great fighting cocks,","you see, known to be the greatest of all."]],[2846,["And they have this, you see, excitement","again of the cock-fighting in China."]],[2852,["I mean, you can have of everything in this","world, all absurd things,"]],[2856,["like rugby, football, this, that, I mean,","there’s no end to it!"]],[2861,["So these, these two cocks were to go in for","an international sort of a fight, I think."]],[2872,["So they said, “There is one great saint","living here,"]],[2875,["he makes everyone very powerful.”","So the owner of the cocks went to him"]],[2880,["and he said, “Will you make my these","two cocks very powerful,"]],[2884,["so that they can fight, they can fight","and win?”"]],[2889,["He said, “All right, it’s very simple.","All right, you leave them with me.”"]],[2895,["So after a month when he appeared","to take the cocks,"]],[2899,["they would not react to anything, they","were just standing like this, watching."]],[2904,["He got a fright of his life, he said,","“How are they going to fight?”"]],[2907,["He said, “You just take them, you’ll see.”"]],[2910,["So he took them to the arena and put them","there,"]],[2915,["and all the cocks, you see, invaded","each other, fought."]],[2919,["These they were just watching, these two","were watching!"]],[2924,["And all the rest of them got so frightened","with these two, they all ran away -"]],[2928,["and they won!"]],[2933,["So the person who is peaceful is","the powerful [one]."]],[2939,["The one who does not react to anything","else, is the most powerful."]],[2949,["So, one has to understand that peace","is the criteria to know"]],[2955,["that you are absolutely at that point","where you have to be."]],[2964,["But peace by no chance means cowardliness."]],[2967,["Because, you see, I know what indiscretion","is, human indiscretion."]],[2971,["They think then cowardliness. No. You stand","like this - not like this."]],[2978,["The difference between a peaceful person","and a cowardly person is"]],[2982,["that a cowardly person acts to the negative","forces,"]],[2987,["and a peaceful person creates positive","forces, constructive forces."]],[2993,["Generates it."]],[3000,["So you are not to be cowardly, but you","have to be peaceful."]],[3004,["And a peaceful person is like a magnet,","you see, so soothing it is."]],[3010,["So you can see now we are moving towards","the soothing qualities of the Spirit."]],[3017,["We have to soothe others, and not","to excite, but to soothe."]],[3024,["And that soothing quality, what you call,","is, we call it like the ghee:"]],[3034,["when the body is charred and is absolutely","burning,"]],[3041,["then you put some sort of a ghee on it","so it becomes smooth,"]],[3050,["like lubrication, [a] lubricant. Such","a personality is a lubricant."]],[3059,["It doesn’t go into friction, but reduces","frictions."]],[3066,["It’s a lubricant temperament."]],[3069,["So you should judge yourself, “Am I","a lubricant personality?”"]],[3074,["For example, you see two persons","are fighting, all right?"]],[3079,["And one goes as a peace-maker;"]],[3084,["and one goes to excite it more, you see,","he joins them."]],[3088,["Now the one who is the peacemaker","is the blessed one,"]],[3091,["is the one who is the one moving towards","God because he is the peacemaker."]],[3101,["“Blessed are those who are","the peacemakers.”"]],[3105,["All these things if you see are, what I am","telling today is the same –"]],[3109,["but in a different language, that’s all –","what Christ said it."]],[3113,["To understand Christ you have to open","Him out more,"]],[3115,["because He said it in very simple words,","which has very deep meanings"]],[3120,["and only a Sahaja Yogi can understand Him."]],[3126,["So you have to make peace."]],[3130,["I have seen people been given Nobel prizes","of peace, who have no peace within at all."]],[3136,["They are hot-tempered, horrible people and","given Nobel prize for peace! All right."]],[3143,["And personified temper, absolutely","hot-tempered; and you call it peace!"]],[3149,["How can you have peace with a person","who is so hot-tempered?"]],[3155,["So this is possible. In this human","endeavour anything is possible, you see."]],[3160,["It’s sometimes so absurd, you see."]],[3164,["Like I have seen people getting a degree,","“doctorate of learning”,"]],[3171,["who has not even been to a school, who","doesn’t know how to read the book!"]],[3176,["Anything is possible because it is just","a maneuvering of everything,"]],[3181,["it’s so artificial."]],[3188,["So the lubrication of your love, the love."]],[3200,["So the love that you enjoy is not what","is bestowed upon you,"]],[3204,["but what you bestow upon others."]],[3208,["The idea of love is also funny."]],[3211,["It’s just the opposite of what you have","seen so far."]],[3218,["They’ll write, “I love you”, all right?"]],[3221,["And the second sentence will be,","“I want to divorce you.”"]],[3228,["And the modern fashion is like that.","“I love you;"]],[3231,["I want to divorce you because I love you","too much!”"]],[3242,["“Because I want to spare you!” Is very","modern, very sophisticated it is."]],[3253,["So the love that hurts others, love that","tortures others,"]],[3260,["the love that expects, is not love."]],[3264,["Love that just flows, just forgives,","is just compassion,"]],[3272,["is the most enjoyable thing."]],[3276,["Radiant, just like the sunshine,","like Christ"]],[3281,["who even forgave those who crucified Him!","Imagine! Imagine!"]],[3293,["Because He knew that God will not forgive.","Even God will not forgive those –"]],[3297,["He tried to forgive them."]],[3305,["But we, those who call themselves","Christians,"]],[3308,["those who are supposed to be Christians","are just the opposite of Christ,"]],[3313,["just the opposite in every way, if you see,","just the opposite."]],[3320,["So, you come to a point where you","understand that you become the love."]],[3328,["And when it is pure love relationships,"]],[3332,["then there is no lust and greed or","anything, but just love and purity of love."]],[3340,["You don’t want to do it  because you","want to have"]],[3347,["any lust out of that person. Just see,","the opposite."]],[3352,["Here the girl is very ‘attractive’. What is","so attractive?"]],[3358,["They, to my eyes they look like mosquitoes;","Horrible! Sometimes like witches, you know."]],[3365,["Their nails and all that look like, to me,","like witches: so artificial."]],[3370,["Just like machines, sometimes."]],[3373,["What is so attractive in these women?","Or in these men? You see."]],[3379,["They look like skulls to me, sometimes and","sometimes like, Frankenstein"]],[3383,["I don’t know what they look like, horrible.","The way they walk,"]],[3388,["the way they try to impress. I mean,","nothing but fear comes out of them."]],[3393,["So, what you emit out of your love","to others"]],[3398,["[is] a sense of security, an ocean","of security you can call it."]],[3405,["Everyone feels secured, secured with you."]],[3411,["And that security will be felt by you."]],[3418,["Trust, trust others. You must trust.","That is very important."]],[3426,["Trust for everything. I have seen some","people are very serious on money,"]],[3431,["some are very serious about possessions,","some are this. I know they…"]],[3437,["they are sometimes weak people."]],[3442,["Could be weak about money, could be","weak about possessions,"]],[3446,["could be even insulting to things that","should not be so:"]],[3450,["but don’t lose your temper, just have","forgiveness for them,"]],[3458,["and let them feel secured, absolutely","secured. Trust."]],[3463,["You see, as you know that I never ask","the trustees to give me any reports."]],[3468,["I do not ask them to give me any – what you","call - the accounts or anything."]],[3473,["I don’t understand accounts at all myself,","you see."]],[3476,["So I never see how many accounts you","have got, what money you have got"]],[3480,["or, say, supposing Gavin is saying that,","“I am sending money now, Mother, to you,”"]],[3484,["whatever I receive, iIt’s all right –","finished."]],[3486,["I don’t know whether he gives you","receipts or not, nothing."]],[3488,["If he says so [it’s] all right. I leave it","to him."]],[3491,["He has to grow, whatever it is. It is","his responsibility,"]],[3494,["if he’s not grown up enough he’ll grow.","So trust others because in Sahaja Yoga"]],[3499,["you must know we are all growing, we are","all transforming."]],[3503,["So we must grow, we must grow","and for growth"]],[3508,["security is the most important thing."]],[3512,["If there is no security for a tree it will","never grow."]],[3517,["So everybody should feel secured","in the company of Sahaja Yogis."]],[3524,["If there is any insecurity from someone","then it should be reported"]],[3530,["to the collective and [you] should see that","all such cases of insecurity creating,"]],[3536,["trouble creators should be, little bit,","taken out for the time being."]],[3542,["Because there should be a healthy growth."]],[3544,["But growth must take place and for that","you must trust."]],[3548,["Somebody might make mistakes – all right,","doesn’t matter."]],[3551,["Somebody may be dishonest – doesn’t matter.","But give them security."]],[3558,["But what we do is to give security","to bhoots, I have seen, [it’s] very common."]],[3563,["People will have only interest","in the bhootish people."]],[3568,["They will trust a bhootish people than to","trust a person who is a little dishonest."]],[3571,["Doesn’t matter. You see, what is","dishonesty?"]],[3574,["Supposing somebody doesn’t give income","tax, doesn’t matter,"]],[3576,["it is this government, or it’s that","government. What does it matter to us?"]],[3580,["As long as that person is honest to God","it’s sufficient."]],[3584,["Our honesty is of a different level. So we","become angry with that person,"]],[3589,["we get upset with that person. There’s","nothing to get angry."]],[3594,["Actually my system as you know is that","I know also that people"]],[3598,["who have mismanaged money, who have","not been all right, I know it, somehow,"]],[3603,["without knowing accounts. But I said,","“Just forgive, forgive, forgive”."]],[3607,["I know everything but I just say,","“Forgive, doesn’t matter.”"]],[3613,["Then, you might say, with rationality,","that, “Mother, such a person"]],[3616,["will go ahead with it”. No he won’t!","You try and trust."]],[3621,["Why? Because they are growing, they are","coming to light"]],[3627,["and the more light they see the better they","become. This trust has to be there."]],[3636,["Trusting in God that He will give him","the right path."]],[3643,["So this understanding about your growth"]],[3651,["is within yourself, which you can see."]],[3657,["And the highest of all is the collectivity."]],[3661,["Not the fraternity of bhoots, but","collectivity."]],[3666,["Again discretion has to be used – how far","you are collective."]],[3674,["If a person thinks he is a very great","person and he can correct everyone"]],[3677,["and he can punish everyone and do","as he likes, then he is not collective."]],[3684,["But sometimes you have to also understand","that even with bhootish people"]],[3688,["I have to stoop down to conquer them,","to bring them up."]],[3696,["Don’t become like them, try to elevate them","than to go down to their level."]],[3705,["And if you can manage that, then you have","achieved"]],[3708,["what you wanted to do through","your collectivity."]],[3713,["And a person has to be collective. If he is","not collective"]],[3718,["then one must know that there’s something","definitely wrong with that person."]],[3728,["Then what you have to do after detachment","from things [is] the penance part of it."]],[3737,["For this we have to be doing some penance."]],[3741,["For example if you are too much attached","to anything: say you are fond of food."]],[3745,["Many people are, I know that. The tongue","is the worst of all."]],[3750,["If you can control tongue you have","controlled at least 50%"]],[3753,["of your sense organs. If you are attached","to the tongue [you should say,]"]],[3757,["“These days I am going into a big penance,","I am eating just boiled food"]],[3761,["without salt, without anything in it,","just boiled food. Going into penance."]],[3766,["I have to! For 9 months.”"]],[3771,["For me it doesn’t matter. It’s no penance","for me because I’ve no tongue at all,"]],[3776,["no taste buds, [so] I can manage.","So whatever you like too much,"]],[3782,["“Ahaa! I love to have something.” You see,","specially here I’ve seen"]],[3785,["if you see good food or anything – “Mmmm…”"]],[3792,["Now, it’s as cold as ice. Should I have it?","I can if you want,"]],[3798,["but it’s rather cold, I think you would","like to give me hot. All right."]],[3803,["I don’t mind having it. All right."]],[3806,["So now what you have to do is have a kind","of self-directed discipline."]],[3818,["Self-directed. Not on others.","Self-directed."]],[3827,["“Do I meditate in the morning? I don’t.","So what’s wrong with me?"]],[3832,["I’m supposed to be a Sahaja Yogi.”"]],[3837,["Don’t have - nobody has to tell you.","You yourself should do this to yourself."]],[3843,["You are fond of food? “All right, doesn’t","matter, I’ll fast for two days”."]],[3847,["No fasting is allowed in Sahaja Yoga,","all right,"]],[3849,["but fasting for detachment is all right,"]],[3852,["not for God’s Sake, but for your sake","you do it."]],[3856,["“I like a particular type of cake.","All right, I’ll not have it."]],[3861,["I’ll not have it for one year”. But no,","people have to give up,"]],[3864,["then they’ll give up something like","Rhubarb! [a bitter vegetable]"]],[3876,["So one should not be cunning about it, you","see, should not be cunning with yourself."]],[3881,["So what you have to do is to see that,"]],[3884,["“Where does this mind go? What is","the attraction?”"]],[3888,["I mean, even now, I find some people are","like Romeo - Juliets, you see,"]],[3892,["still living in that area of Romeo Juliet-","ness. Get out of it! [It’s] Nonsense."]],[3903,["Get out of that kind of a thing. That","doesn’t mean you become [a] dry personality"]],[3907,["of another extreme, can be, that you just","become like sticks, that’s not the point."]],[3912,["But you should not indulge into","these things."]],[3918,["These are all artificial things."]],[3922,["So a tapah is to be established within","yourself. Self-discipline."]],[3928,["Now those who talk too much should stop","talking, absolutely mauna is the ilaaj."]],[3932,["Mauna is the treatment for such people.","Just don’t talk!"]],[3937,["Those who do not talk, most of the English","men don’t talk, women talk too much."]],[3944,["It’s a fact. I’ve seen – any interview,","you see, the woman will talk first."]],[3949,["This [police] constable lady died, [and]","her mother was talking!"]],[3951,["In India a mother would not be","in a position to talk, you know."]],[3954,["The father was sitting quietly. You just","can’t imagine."]],[3957,["In India supposing a child dies like that,","you see,"]],[3960,["the mother would be absolutely sobbing,","in a mess, she won’t be talking."]],[3964,["Here the woman was talking, we were","so surprised!"]],[3967,["You see, the women talk too much [here],"]],[3970,["men just don’t talk, they are not supposed","to talk, I think, they just keep quiet."]],[3976,["At the most they might be slapping.","I don’t know what they do."]],[3983,["So what we have to do is to teach ourselves"]],[3986,["that, if our tongue talks too much, then we","better keep quiet."]],[3992,["If we do not talk, we better talk, we","should teach ourselves how to talk."]],[3996,["Now go and talk to the sea, go and talk","to some tree,"]],[3999,["go and talk to someone like that. Or best","is to talk to me, to my photograph."]],[4007,["So that’s how you achieve a kind","of a control over your tongue."]],[4013,["To talk sweetly. Some people have to go","through penance for that."]],[4018,["For them to talk sweetly is like taking","rhubarb again"]],[4027,["They just can’t talk sweetly, just can’t.","Sarcasm."]],[4031,["You see, in that sarcasm they have","a special pleasure."]],[4040,["Try to say something sweetly. You can be","humorous without being sarcastic."]],[4046,["Humour is the best way. What is the need","to be sarcastic?"]],[4050,["There’s no need at all. Is a sign","of cowardliness, I think, sarcasm,"]],[4054,["is a sign that you want to hurt others,","but you are not straightforward."]],[4058,["So try to avoid sarcastic talking."]],[4062,["If you are sarcastic, better tell your","tongue to behave itself."]],[4067,["So, little disciplining towards yourself,","punishment what you call,"]],[4072,["or the tapah, the penance has to work out."]],[4076,["Now people have so many ways of, you see,","seeing things."]],[4080,["Some men want to see women all the time,","some women want to see men all the time"]],[4085,["or clothes or anything, you see.","Now, the difference is that"]],[4089,["when you see something, it reacts."]],[4093,["The difference between my looking","at anything is that, that reacts."]],[4104,["When I look at you, your Kundalini reacts,","when I look at this, it gets vibrated."]],[4110,["Kataksha, kataksha: Every eye… -","Kataksha, what is… -"]],[4117,["every glance, every glance"]],[4123,["makes the thing react. And nirikshana","means, I know what it is."]],[4129,["I know what it is. Just looking at a person","I know what it is."]],[4132,["Looking at a thing, I know what it is -","nirikshana."]],[4137,["And the whole thing is in the memory","there, you see."]],[4139,["Like, we were going and they said","we have only black stones."]],[4143,["I said, “No, you have red also.” He said,","“Where do you know?”"]],[4146,["So I told them [the] exact spot where","to get the red stones."]],[4148,["They said, “How do you know, Mother?”","I said, “We passed that way"]],[4151,["about eight days back and I know there","are red stones.”"]],[4154,["So everything I see gets vibrated and also","I note"]],[4161,["what is there, and is all ready there to be","used at a proper time."]],[4170,["But what do I do? What do I do?","I do nothing."]],[4180,["I do nothing. I don’t think, I don’t plan.","Everything that you do, I don’t do."]],[4191,["So when you have that kind of a temperament","you’ll be amazed,"]],[4200,["the amount of dynamism that will work","it out."]],[4204,["You don’t have to create a dynamo, it’s","inside you. Let it work it out."]],[4211,["Today I had told Gavin that I won’t have","so much of a puja but I’ll talk."]],[4216,["Because puja is all right, it talks","for itself and this thing."]],[4219,["But I wanted to talk to you because now","the time has come for us to go further."]],[4225,["As a result of all this, all this, that","when you do [it],"]],[4230,["you become the Truth, you become the Truth."]],[4238,["So, in every chakra if you concentrate,","and use the chakra"]],[4243,["to detach yourself from the particular","quality of that chakra."]],[4250,["Like, now for example, the Nabhi chakra","does the digestion."]],[4256,["Now you don’t worry what you should","eat to digest."]],[4261,["Just detach yourself from there, with","vibrations, if you just see and eat"]],[4266,["whatever is there, you will digest."]],[4273,["And then you become the Truth. Truth","that is love, that is God."]],[4279,["May God Bless you all."]],[4301,["Shri Mataji: Yes. Gavin, what – you have","all the arrangements from the company…"]],[4307,["whatever I like.","Gavin: Whatever You want."]],[4313,["Of course I’ve told you about the egg now,"]],[4316,["now you have become the chickens already.","Only you have to grow, that’s all."]],[4325,["Breaking so many eggs every day, isn’t it?"]],[4332,["Easter is something like our birthday","we celebrate;"]],[4335,["when we became a bird out of the cage,","of the shell."]],[4343,["So Easter is our birthday we","are celebrating, of our Realization,"]],[4349,["and every day we must grow with","our birthday."]],[4353,["While in a human form you decrease your","age, as your birthday comes in,"]],[4362,["but with this you increase your age, and","you are proud that you are growing."]],[4369,["On a human level you feel unhappy that","you are growing."]],[4375,["Here you feel proud that you are growing."]],[4378,["Just the opposite of what you are doing","if you try to do it, it will be nice."]],[4387,["I mean, that doesn’t mean again indiscreet,","you know?"]],[4390,["I’m quite worried on that point."]],[4393,["Discretion is the first thing that you","should have before you."]],[4397,["Now if you have any questions you can","ask Me,"]],[4400,["for about five, ten minutes till I take My","tea and then we’ll have a little puja."]],[4409,["…questions have it before the puja, and","then - or after the puja is better"]],[4418,["whatever you say. Yogi: After, Mother."]],[4421,["Shri Mataji: Eh? After. Yogi: Yes.","Shri Mataji: All right."]]]);
